$","$20$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"d8a8ee99b4196a89cb24b91b","time_limit":20},{"id":"pt_batch8_normal_distribution_013","difficulty":"challenge","question_type":"conceptual","question":"Let $X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$ and let $a,b$ be real constants with $a\\ne0$. What is the distribution of $aX+b$?","options":["$N(a\\mu+b,\\ a\\sigma^{2})$","$N(\\mu+b,\\ \\sigma^{2})$","it is not normal in general","$N(a\\mu+b,\\ a^{2}\\sigma^{2})$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"4fb82da3507ede423e5cb02a","time_limit":40},{"id":"pt_batch8_normal_distribution_016","difficulty":"standard","question_type":"application","question":"For $X\\sim N(2,16)$, which standardized variable should be standard normal?","options":["$(X-16)/2$","$4(X-2)$","$X+2$","$(X-2)/4$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"dec12600971e8f6784dbc3a4","time_limit":30},{"id":"pt_batch8_normal_distribution_018","difficulty":"challenge","question_type":"conceptual","question":"If $X\\sim N(\\mu_1,\\sigma_1^2)$ and $Y\\sim N(\\mu_2,\\sigma_2^2)$ are independent, what is the distribution of $X-Y$?","options":["$N(\\mu_1-\\mu_2,\\ \\sigma_1^{2}+\\sigma_2^{2})$","$N(\\mu_1-\\mu_2,\\ \\sigma_1^{2}-\\sigma_2^{2})$","$N(\\mu_1+\\mu_2,\\ \\sigma_1^{2}+\\sigma_2^{2})$","$N(\\mu_1-\\mu_2,\\ |\\sigma_1^{2}-\\sigma_2^{2}|)$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"bcef8bda8f89beb1905e877a","time_limit":40},{"id":"pt_batch8_normal_distribution_010_curated20261027_001","difficulty":"standard","question_type":"application","question":"Let $X\\sim\\mathcal{N}(3,4)$. Which probability equals $\\mathbb{P}(X<1)$?","options":["$\\mathbb{P}(X>5)$","$\\mathbb{P}(X>-1)$","$\\mathbb{P}(X<5)$","$\\mathbb{P}(X>1)$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"f3f9d45819d38a504878bbe4","time_limit":30},{"id":"pt_batch8_normal_distribution_012_curated20261027_002","difficulty":"standard","question_type":"application","question":"Let $X\\sim\\mathcal{N}(1,4)$ and $Y\\sim\\mathcal{N}(3,5)$ be indepen